Z||000008||AusFiero||05-12-2001||11:03 AM||||I had actually considered the move the spare and put a top in the front scenario. But only very briefly  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>The popout window I thought was great until I tried to figure where to store it safely.<P>But seeing someone bought up pickup trucks I suppose a sliding back window would work. Cut half the decklid off so the kids can sit in the boot. The worlds first Fiero pickup. And an added bonus if you use a GT Fastback, somewhere to hold onto when your using the remaining bit of decklid as a shooting platform. <P>Please don't anybody do this. If you already have I am sure your Rottweillers find it an attractive addition to sleep in outside your trailer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||1
