Z||000017||WKDFIRO||05-12-2001||09:08 PM||||The power rear window would also be great to find out if you have an exhuast leak...it would be great! Since the manifold in the front nearest the back window is the first to crack it would be very easy!<P>First you see your fingernails glowing red then you try to pull over before you die of asphyxiation...<P>This idea has been kicked around for a long time. The modular B-pillar is actually a good idea but unless you have cut one of those before you won't really be able to appreciate how many layers of steel make up the torsional rigidity of that pillar. Chassis braces give some of the rigidity back but the chassis will never have the same it did. <P>Its down right unnerving how much one of them flexes even with a brace.||||reg||12
